---
interface Props { illustrated?: boolean; }
const { illustrated = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={["workflow-cards", { "workflow-cards--illustrated": illustrated }]} role="region" aria-label="Workflows">
  <div class="feature-card">
    {illustrated && <div class="workflow-card__visual workflow-card__visual--chat" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><path d="M11 14h42v29H29l-12 8v-8h-6V14Z"/><path d="M20 25h24M20 33h16"/></svg></div>}
    <h3>Chat</h3>
    <p>Ask a question and get an answer in the Thread. Chat requests are sent read-only: the Worker answers and does not change files.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    {illustrated && <div class="workflow-card__visual workflow-card__visual--work" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><path d="M12 19h16l5 5h19v25H12V19Z"/><path d="m25 36 5 5 10-11"/></svg></div>}
    <h3>Work</h3>
    <p>Give a Worker a task to carry out on the host computer, such as editing a document or changing code in the Space's folder.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    {illustrated && <div class="workflow-card__visual workflow-card__visual--research" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><circle cx="27" cy="27" r="15"/><path d="m38 38 13 13M21 27h12M27 21v12"/></svg></div>}
    <h3>Research</h3>
    <p>Several Workers look into the same question in parallel, then one combines their findings into a single comparison.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card">
    {illustrated && <div class="workflow-card__visual workflow-card__visual--implement" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><rect x="10" y="11" width="44" height="42" rx="5"/><path d="m19 23 4 4 6-7m5 5h11M19 38l4 4 6-7m5 5h11"/></svg></div>}
    <h3>Implement</h3>
    <p>A full engineering cycle, <strong>Plan → Implement → Verify</strong>, with each step and its result recorded in the Thread.</p>
  </div>
</div>
